      "text": "$$a(2+i)^4 + b(2+i)^3 + c(2+i)^2 + b(2+i) + a=(a+c+1)(2+i)^2-b(2+i)+a=(a+c+1)(6+4i)-b(2+i)+a=(a+c+1)(6+4i)-b(2+i)+a.$$Therefore,\n\\begin{align*}\n&(a+c+1)(6+4i)-b(2+i)+a=(6a+b+c+1)(2+i)^2-(2b-a)(2+i)=\\\\\n&=(6a+b+c+1)(6+4i)-(2b-a)(6+4i)=\\\\\n&(6a+b+c+1)(6+4i)-(2a-2b)(6+4i)=(6a+b+c+1-2a+2b)(6+4i)=\\\\\n&(4a+b+c+2)(6+4i)=0.\n\\end{align*}Since $a,b,c$ are integers, they can only take the value $0$.  Thus, $b=a=c=-1$.  Therefore, $|c|=\\boxed{1}$. The answer is: 1",
